WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.094 --> 00:00:01.622
♫ ["Sweet Child o' Mine"
by Guns N' Roses] ♫

00:00:01.672 --> 00:00:03.727
THOR
There's a maniac who seeks to end us all.

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:06.731
I'm putting together
the greatest team ever.

00:00:06.781 --> 00:00:07.716
JANE FOSTER
Are you packed?

00:00:09.022 --> 00:00:09.651
Yes!

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:12.352
[Goats screaming]

00:00:13.383 --> 00:00:14.309
♪♪

00:00:14.359 --> 00:00:15.192
THOR
We've got Korg...

00:00:15.242 --> 00:00:16.642
KORG
He's my best friend!

00:00:16.693 --> 00:00:17.317
THOR
Yes!

00:00:18.586 --> 00:00:20.039
THOR
There's my ex-girlfriend Jane...

00:00:22.016 --> 00:00:22.766
THOR
Valkyrie...

00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:24.680
VALKYRIE
This is the best day of my life!

00:00:25.282 --> 00:00:26.266
THOR
The Guardians...

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:28.258
GROOT
I am Groot!

00:00:28.828 --> 00:00:29.903
[Goats screaming]

00:00:29.953 --> 00:00:31.063
KORG
And giant goats!

00:00:31.114 --> 00:00:33.638
THOR
Oh, look at those, they are wonderful!

00:00:33.688 --> 00:00:34.583
KORG
Yes, they are.

00:00:34.633 --> 00:00:35.924
They also scream quite a lot.

00:00:35.974 --> 00:00:37.463
[Goat screaming]

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:42.718
♫ Oh, oh, oh, oh
Sweet child of mine ♫

00:00:44.162 --> 00:00:46.451
ROCKET
You said this would be a relaxing holiday!

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:54.627
THOR
I said it was going to be

00:00:54.677 --> 00:00:56.292
"like" a relaxing holiday.

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:02.479
♫ Whoa, oh
Sweet child of mine ♫

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:06.193
THOR
Human handshake, to the Asgardian shake,

00:01:06.244 --> 00:01:09.537
into the snake
that you cannot trust... [Hisses]

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:11.003
PETER QUILL
You're really dragging this out.

00:01:11.053 --> 00:01:12.112
THOR
...finish with the classic

00:01:12.162 --> 00:01:14.157
Asgardian High One.

00:01:15.633 --> 00:01:16.618
[Mimicking explosion]

